itle":"How effective was the product?","type":"range","value":5,"maxLabel":"Great!"}],"body":"My mum got this in an advent calendar and gave it to me. I’d been thinking about getting a lash serum for months but I was unsure due to the risk of under eye circles darkening (I already have deep set dark under eyes so I didn’t really want to contribute to the problem). After the researching the product after my mum gave it to me and seeing that this serum did not contain the ingredient that causes that side effect I decided to give it a go . And oh my lord. It’s been 2 weeks and I can already notice a huge difference. My lashes are thicker and longer and I’ve actually had to relearn how to use my mascara because I’m not used to having lashes so long ! I know it’s in the pricey side, but I will definitely be repurchasing once I’ve run out of my gifted serum . I know they’re only eyelashes, but they’ve just given me that extra little boost of confidence ! ","dateCreated":"2024-03-16T15:44:03.224Z","dateUpdated":"2024-03-16T15:44:03.224Z","helpfulCount":1,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productAttributes":[{"title":"How often are you using the product?","type":"single-value","value":"Twice a day"},{"title":"How long have you been using the product?","type":"single-value","value":"30 days (1 month)"},{"title":"What improvements have you noticed?","type":"multi-value","value":["Improved lash/brow length","Improved lash/brow density","Easy to incorporate in daily routine"]}],"productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":5,"reviewer":{"attributes":[{"title":"Age Range","type":"single-value","value":"Under 24"},{"title":"What are your concerns?","type":"multi-value","value":["Short lashes"]}],"displayName":"Emily","isVerified":true,"verifiedStatus":"Verified Re