chemo in October. I finished chemo 6 weeks ago and I still have my lashes because of this serum! I always had long and thick lashes and I did lose a little bit volume during treatment, but not length.  An oncology nurse just told me I have the longest lashes she has even seen, after going what I went through, that comment made my day. Before I started chemo, I checked with my doctor to make sure it was ok to use this serum, and with her approval, I used this serum twice a day.  There was a spot on my lower lashes that were missing a few hairs before I started treatment and I kid you not, it filled in while I was losing my hair everywhere else! I don't know what is in this serum, but it works and you should give it a try. ","dateCreated":"2024-02-07T23:23:53.757Z","dateUpdated":"2024-02-07T23:23:53.757Z","helpfulCount":2,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productAttributes":[{"title":"How often are you using the product?","type":"single-value","value":"Twice a day"},{"title":"How long have you been using the product?","value":"150 days (5 months) or more","type":"single-value"},{"title":"What improvements have you noticed?","type":"multi-value","value":["Improved lash/brow density","Improved lash/brow length","Improved lash/brow strength","Easy to incorporate in daily routine"]}],"productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","productVariantName":"Subscription","rating":5,"reviewer":{"attributes":[{"type":"single-value","value":"25-34","title":"Age Range"},{"value":["Hair loss from hormonal changes (incl postpartum)","Brittle lashes"],"title":"What are your concerns?","type":"multi-value"}],"displayName":"G.M.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"Kept my lashes during chemo!","unhelpfulCount":0,"variantId":"16861989863539"},{"s